yment 20,913.8055 (both WETH Transfer amounts in the receipt)","expr":"(a-b)/1e18","ops":{"a":{"int":28994303891868396965958},"b":{"int":20913805500000000000000}}}]},{"t":null,"utc":"2023-03-13T09:08:59Z","prec":null,"kind":"tx","actor":"hacker 0xB2698","detail":"last big exploit call (stETH 0x6d21d1e8) in block 16818085; USDC->DAI swap at 16818068, withdraw of 34.19M DAI to 0xb66cd966 at 16818102 (09:12:23Z)","tx":"0x298bde3f9e53f7a5d870f7f5d56ee2f5e41fa25e6eb5e74611ac97025405db55","block":16818102,"raw":"raw/etherscan/txlist_0xB2698C2D99aD2C302a95A8Db26B08d17A77CEdd4_0_16830000_asc_1_60.json","raws":["raw/etherscan/txlist_0xB2698C2D99aD2C302a95A8Db26B08d17A77CEdd4_0_16830000_asc_1_60.json"],"raw_note":null,"derived":null},{"t":null,"utc":"2023-03-13T10:40:59Z","prec":null,"kind":"message","actor":"third party 0x915447 -> copier","detail":"inbound dust/message txs to the copier from other addresses begin (block 16818540)","tx":"0xbf295a011f0088d8a5cad4b9a15d3acebe3a4b5184f20af5ec69a07384b69a2c","block":16818540,"raw":"raw/etherscan/txlist_0x5F259D0b76665c337c6104145894F4D1D2758B8c_16810000_16830000_asc_1_60.json","raws":["raw/etherscan/txlist_0x5F259D0b76665c337c6104145894F4D1D2758B8c_16810000_16830000_asc_1_60.json"],"raw_note":null,"derived":null},{"t":null,"utc":"2023-03-13T11:38:11Z","prec":null,"kind":"return","actor":"copier 0x5F259D0b -> copy #1","detail":"withdraw(): 8,877,507.35 DAI to hard-coded 0xb66cd966 (hacker wallet)","tx":"0xdae809e4a1ddf77c39d44a4acfe6165bedbc19a385c4b241242cc9bd582a80b9","block":16818823,"raw":"raw/rpc/trace_tx_0xdae809e4a1ddf77c39d44a4acfe6165bedbc19a385c4b241242cc9bd582a80b9.json","raws":["raw/rpc/trace_tx_0xdae809e4a1ddf77c39d44a4acfe6165bedbc19a385c4b241242cc9bd582a80b9.json"],"raw_note":null,"derived":null},{"t":null,"utc":"2023-03-13T12:08:35Z","prec":null,"kind":"message","actor":"copier 0x5F259D0b","detail":"on-chain self-transfer with text: 'I am the owner of a MEV bot that has accidentally frontrun the first tx of the hacker...' (full text in incident.json notes)","tx":"0x44b559c86ca8ccac5c16df507516ef19c06042a48cdbd865cb9db4c52d15ea17","block":16818973,"raw":"raw/rpc/tx_0x44b559c86ca8ccac5c16df507516ef19c06042a48cdbd865cb9db4c52d15ea17.json","raws":["raw/rpc/tx_0x44b559c86ca8ccac5c16df507516ef19c06042a48cdbd865cb9db4c52d15ea17.json"],"raw_note":null,"derived":null}],"fate":{"kind":"kept","text":"Nothing reached Euler from this row. The copier's contract can only pay the address hard-coded in its bytecode, so its withdraw() (block 16818823, about 2 h 47 min after the exploit) sent all 8,877,507.35 DAI to the attacker's wallet. The copier's on-chain message (tx 0x44b559c8, block 16818973) says it tried to return the money and 'unfortunately it sent the money to the hacker's address'. Any later return by the Euler hacker to Euler is outside this row and not covered by our saved files.","returned_pct":null},"incident_raw":{"bot_attack_trace":"raw/rpc/trace_tx_0xc310a0affe2169d1f6feec1c63dbc7f7c62a887fa48795d327d4d2da2d6b111d.json","hacker_creation_tx":"raw/rpc/tx_0x50dc9c9126519a70319cc312418488145bed4e2ef6e110eb864a97f5beaeca05.json","copier_creation_tx":"raw/rpc/tx_0x725db76cf4bf3bdc72be4f755ed72df4adbc8e4e803c044617cc11e34907ccdc.json","withdraw_trace":"raw/rpc/trace_tx_0xdae809e4a1ddf77c39d44a4acfe6165bedbc19a385c4b241242cc9bd582a80b9.json","flashbots_bids_16817996":"raw/relay-flashbots/bids_block16817996.json","flashbots_delivered_16817996":"raw/relay-flashbots/delivered_block16817996.json","euler_logs":"raw/etherscan/elogs_0x27182842E098f60e3D576794A5bFFb0777E025d3_16817900_16818100.json"},"timeline_notes":[],"sources":["https://www.certik.com/resources/blog/4iSrYY6HoaYxk1aKyjFb5v-euler-finance-incident-analysis","https://eigenphi.substack.com/p/200-million-heist-unmasked-unraveling","https://etherscan.io/tx/0xc310a0affe2169d1f6feec1c63dbc7f7c62a887fa48795d327d4d2da2d6b111d","https://etherscan.io/tx/0x44b559c86ca8ccac5c16df507516ef19c06042a48cdbd865cb9db4c52d15ea17","https://etherscan.io/address/0x5F259D0b76665c337c6104145894F4D1D2758B8c","https://boost-relay.flashbots.net/relay/v1/data/bidtraces/builder_blocks_received?block_number=16817996"],"dataset_money":{"scope":"bot-tx","coinbase_eth":0.0,"paid_to_builder_eth":0.07390378,"builder_refund_eth":0.0,"note":"bot_net_eth is 0: the copier captured nothing. The DAI sat in its copy until the copier itself called withdraw() (tx 0xdae809e4, block 16818823), which sent all 8,877,507.35 DAI to the wallet baked into the creation code (0xb66cd966670d962c227b3eaba30a872dbfb995db, the attacker's wallet). Costs are NOT netted: the attack tx cost 0.1108 ETH of gas (0.0739 ETH tip + base fee), about 0.61 ETH across all the copier's txs per incident.json. Euler's net DAI-market loss in this tx was 8,904,507.35 DAI (Euler paid out 38,904,507.35 DAI and received 30,000,000 DAI); the whole Euler hack is about $197M (PeckShield figure, not re-verified here). No coinbase transfer: the tip (0.0739 ETH) is 78% of the 0.09425 ETH winning bid, so position 0 came from the public gas-price auction, not a bundle. No builder refund seen."},"title":"Euler Finance (copied contract)","sub_label":null,"evidence_strength":"medium","evidence_strength_basis":"The copier may be the attacker\u2019s own second account: it was a fresh single-purpose EOA, kept the attacker\u2019s cash-out wallet and captured nothing. Its own on-chain message is the only claim that it was a bot.","public_ordering":null,"comparison_policy":null,"caveat":"The copier may be the attacker\u2019s own second account: it was a fresh single-purpose EOA, kept the attacker\u2019s cash-out wallet and captured nothing. Its own on-chain message is the only claim that it was a bot.","headline":false,"timeline_publication_gaps":[]}